	(text "This is a clone of the Commodore 8296 High-Res Emulator (HRE)\nboard. The HRE is a board plus firmware that emulates the\nCommodore High-Speed Grahic (HSG) board which contains a\nThomson EF9365/EF9366 Video Display Processor (VDP). The HRE\nfirmware implements the same BASIC commands as the HSG but\ndoes the drawing with the 6502 processor rather than the VDP chip.\n\nThanks to Andy Grady for sorting out some of the traces\nunder the chips!"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 248.666 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "187bb149-26c1-458e-86b5-286ac0146f19")
	)
	(text "8296 HRE Clone"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.764 228.6 0)
