	(text "The CHR ROM socket supports a\n2316 (2K) or 2332 (4K). Normally\nit is only 2K except for\nSuperPET or some DIN machines.\n* Pin 18 is used as A11.\n* Pin 21 is used as /CS\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36.068 167.64 0)
